              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword, pilum, light armour, shield. Optional (opponent's permission, out-of-period scenarios). Total Imitation Legionary figures may not outnumber the total number of Warriors; they count as infantry in the Army Composition. (Hannibal p.75)</characteristic>
